SUMMARY:Flow at Bartram’s Garden: Community Yoga in the Garden
LOCATION:Coach House\, 5400 Lindbergh Blvd\, Philadelphia\, PA 19143
DESCRIPTION:Flow at Bartram’s Garden is a community-centered outdoor yoga
  series hosted by Healing the Hood Together (formerly Hood Healers PHL)\, 
 designed to create space for rest\, movement\, and reconnection with natur
 e. Each class invites participants of all levels to slow down\, breathe de
 eply\, and experience the healing power of movement in one of Philly’s m
 ost beautiful green spaces. This series centers accessibility\, community 
 care\, and wellness for the people — welcoming beginners\, families\, an
 d…\n\nListing: https://www.bartramsgarden.org/event/hthtflownov26/
URL:https://www.bartramsgarden.org/event/hthtflownov26/
CATEGORIES:---Yoga & Meditation,Arts & Performance,Classes & Workshops,Fami
 ly Activities,Free Community Events,Series
