SUMMARY:Little Explorers: What’s Buzzing and Blooming?
LOCATION:Bartram’s Garden Courtyard\, Coach House and Barn\, 5400 Lindber
 gh Blvd.\, Philadelphia\, PA 19143
DESCRIPTION:Who knows what we’ll find in the Garden?  Come with us to ex
 plore!\n\nABOUT LITTLE EXPLORERS:\n\nEvery first and third Wednesday of th
 e month\, March through November\, 10-11:30am. Join us for exploration\, a
  garden walk\, and stories! Please feel free to bring a snack.\n\nDesigned
  for toddlers and preschoolers\, ages 2-4. One adult chaperone is required
  for every two children.\n\nFor more information\, email Leslie Gale\, lga
 le@bartramsgarden.org.\n\nListing: https://www.bartramsgarden.org/event/20
 26little-explorers-buzz-11/
URL:https://www.bartramsgarden.org/event/2026little-explorers-buzz-11/
CATEGORIES:---Birding,---Little Explorers,Classes & Workshops,Eligible for 
 SW/ACCESS Discount,Family Activities,Series
